          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Make a lampstand of pure gold. Make its base and its shaft of hammered gold; its decorative flowers, including buds and petals, are to form one piece with it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Six branches shall extend from its sides, three from each side. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Each of the six branches is to have three decorative flowers shaped like almond blossoms with buds and petals. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The shaft of the lampstand is to have four decorative flowers shaped like almond blossoms with buds and petals. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There is to be one bud below each of the three pairs of branches. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The buds, the branches, and the lampstand are to be a single piece of pure hammered gold. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make seven lamps for the lampstand and set them up so that they shine towards the front. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make its tongs and trays of pure gold. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Use 35 kilogrammes of pure gold to make the lampstand and all this equipment. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 7.44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.8.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 8.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take care to make them according to the plan that I showed you on the mountain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
